              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana ma Isilaeli mekaa ũu, na mamaumaalasya ũtee wa mwako wa maeema; o tondũ Yeova wamũtavisye Mose, nĩw’o ana ma Isilaeli mekaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.4",
