            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ethĩwa mũndũ ũsu nde na mũndũ wa mũvĩa wake ũla ũtonya kũĩvĩwa ũvĩtan’yo ũsu, kĩla kĩkũĩvĩwa ĩvĩtyo yake kwa Yeova kĩkeethĩwa kya mũthembi; eka ndũũme ya wĩw’anĩthyo, ĩla wĩw’anĩthw’a kwondũ wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.8"
            ]
